From f393031c60f8dc7ba7b3d377dbd43b05b1c0cf32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Team A12 <swaminadhanbs@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:13:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] CH03: parental control

- Profile.maturityLevel (KIDS / TEEN / ADULT, default ADULT so existing
  profiles keep their behaviour); selectable on the edit-profile form.
- MaturityRule inserted between RegionRule and PremiumContentRule in the
  Content Access Rule Chain (hidden-before-locked ordering).
- catalogue.checkAccess applies the selected profile's rating and
  refuses profiles of other accounts; myList.create refuses restricted
  titles for the profile.
- Client: ShowsContainer, Hero and search results filter for the active
  profile (Active Profile Selection observers react to maturityLevel).
- Refactor (Duplicate Code) in routers/my-list.ts: one showInput schema
  instead of two identical 17-field objects, findProfileWithList /
  findShowOrThrow / showData helpers replace 3 copied blocks.
- New characterization test for myList update/delete, verified on the
  original code before the refactor.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRtMiqqrPtTNbnvsdMTnUF
